---
const steps = [
  { title: "Product designer", tag: "ModCloth" },
  { title: "Design engineer", tag: "Stitch Fix" },
  { title: "Platform designer", tag: "Stitch Fix" },
  { title: "Systems leader", tag: "Built Technologies · Modern Health" },
  { title: "Product design manager", tag: "Tive — current" },
];
---

<div class="career-path">
  <ol class="path">
    {steps.map((step, i) => (
      <>
        <li class="step" data-current={i === steps.length - 1}>
          <p class="step-title">{step.title}</p>
          <p class="step-tag">{step.tag}</p>
        </li>
        {i < steps.length - 1 && (
          <li class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</li>
        )}
      </>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <p class="path-summary">
    Each step added a lens without dropping the last one—craft, code,
    systems, and now leadership all still inform how I work. I love coaching
    designers, partnering deeply with engineering, and complex systemic
    design challenges.
  </p>
</div>

<style lang="scss">
  .path {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-m);

    @media screen and (max-width: 720px) {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
  }

  .step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3xs);

    &[data-current] .step-title {
      color: var(--color-vibrant-dark);
    }
  }

  .step-title {
    font: var(--font-heading-5);
  }

  .step-tag {
    font: var(--font-body-4);
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .arrow {
    font: var(--font-heading-5);
    color: var(--color-vibrant-dark);
    opacity: 0.6;

    @media screen and (max-width: 720px) {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .path-summary {
    font: var(--font-body-3);
    max-width: 45rem;
  }
</style>
